<%--
Tab_Panel - one semantic panel bound to a tab key

$key - the tab key this panel belongs to (matches a Tab_Bar tab.key)

default content - the panel body

Self-registers with its enclosing Tab_Panels and starts hidden; Tab_Panels
shows exactly the panel whose $key matches the active tab.

Usage:
    <Tab_Panel $key="overview"> ...sections... </Tab_Panel>
--%>
<Define:Tab_Panel role="tabpanel">
    <%= content() %>
</Define:Tab_Panel>
